# News Network — environment variables
#
# This prototype ships with mock article data (see src/data.ts) and does
# NOT require any API key or secret to run, build, or deploy.
#
# When you connect a real news API or RSS feed later, add the variable
# name here (with no real value) as documentation, then set the actual
# value in Vercel under Project Settings -> Environment Variables — never
# commit real keys to GitHub.
#
# Any variable you add must be prefixed with VITE_ to be readable in the
# browser code (that's a Vite requirement), for example:
#
# VITE_NEWS_API_KEY=
# VITE_NEWS_API_BASE_URL=
